h.net/about \n\nNO OTHER APP HAS  ALL THESE FEATURES: \n\n● OVER TEN MILLION Animations!\n● ADD PERSONALIZED TEXT to any animation. Adjust font, color, size, placement, and even scrolling!  \n● SEND using MMS Text Messaging, Email, Facebook, Twitter, Instagram, and more.\n● QUICK SEARCH for ANY specific term, such as \"Fathers Day,\" \"Good morning,\" \"I love you,\" \"Crying,\" etc., and be shown HUNDREDS of animations to choose from.\n● NEW IMAGES DELIVERED REGULARLY directly to your device via our servers.  No need to wait for an app update to get new, fun images.\n● ORGANIZE YOUR FAVORITE animations in user-managed folders for quick access. \n● IMPORT animations from other apps, if by the off chance you can find an animation not already in our massive library.\n● UPDATE your Facebook, Twitter or Instagram status with fun images.\n\n▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬\n\n* A NOTE ABOUT COMPATIBILITY WITH NON-iPHONE USERS:  Sharing images with Facebook, Twitter and Email works with pretty much anyone, but depending on what cell network and type of cell phone the person you're sending to has, some of the images you send via text messaging may not work.   This has nothing to do with the app, but is a factor of the compatibility between: 1) the iPhone, 2) your network provider, 3) the other person's network provider, and 4) the other person's cell phone.  See http://clipish.net/support for more details.\n\n* FAST INTERNET CONNECTION REQUIRED:  Due to the server communication (which lets this app have powerful features that other apps don't have), this app requires a fast Internet connection.\n\n* A NOTE TO FAMILIES:  This app accesses Internet content, but filters out adult content.  For the strongest protection, set your rating filter to Strict, or get the Family Edition of CLIPish.\n\n* ANIMATIONS ON FACEBOOK:  Animations posted to Facebook will be flattened and not animated.  Facebook does this to all animations uploaded.  \n\nSome images featured are public domain.  If you believe your work has been included in err, please let us know so it can be removed immediately.\n\nWRITE US!  Input and suggestions welcome. We're always here to help:  support@clipish.net", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 1, "minimumOsVersion": "8.1", "trackCensoredName": "3D Animations + Emoji Icons", "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/3d-animations-emoji-icons/id383790206?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating": "17+", "releaseDate": "2010-07-30T18:23:18Z", "userRatingCount": 1}]}